    "summary": "The project, which encompasses the areas of Rufisque, Saly, and Joal, aims to protect people, houses, economic and cultural infrastructure in the region against coastal erosion. Across all three project sites, the aim is to develop regulations that encompass adaptation, the revision of the environmental code, the adoption of the law on the littoral, and helping local people better understand adaptation techniques to climate change in coastal areas and about the importance of respecting regulations for the management of littoral zones.",
